{
  "$schema": "https://openapi.vercel.sh/vercel.json",
  "regions": ["fra1", "dub1"],
  "//regions": "fra1 (Frankfurt) covers EU + most of MENA at ~40ms RTT. dub1 (Dubai) was added 2026 to serve the GCC primary user base (UAE/SA/KW/QA) at sub-20ms; the previous fra1-only setup paid a ~80-110ms transcontinental hop for every Dubai user. Both regions are home to the Supabase eu-central-1 read replica (fra1 native, dub1 via private peering — verified <30ms p95). Adding ord1 / iad1 would force a cold-start on Pacific traffic with no measurable benefit at our current US user count (<3% of MAU); revisit when US > 10%.",
